msgid "White poster with bold black text reading: \"The powerful shouldn't choose what we see. We all decide.\" Mozilla Foundation logo at the bottom."
msgstr "Weißes Poster mit fett gedrucktem schwarzem Text: „The powerful shouldn't choose what we see. We all decide.“ Unten befindet sich das Logo der Mozilla Foundation."

